# Cross-site firm outreach

- **policestationagent** firm outreach emails are permanently disabled (`PSA_OUTREACH_EMAILS_DISABLED` in that repo).
- **agent_cover_kent_v1** sends from this Policestationrepuk deployment are also permanently disabled (`AGENT_COVER_EMAILS_DISABLED` / `OUTREACH_SEND_CAMPAIGN_IDS`).
- **Policestationrepuk** WhatsApp / firm invite outreach (`whatsapp_invite_v1`) must keep running.
- Do not set `FIRM_OUTREACH_FORCE_AGENT_COVER_SEND=true` or re-add agent_cover to send/probe/kick paths unless the user explicitly asks to resume Agent-branded outreach.
- If an agent task mentions “stop outreach”, confirm which site. Default for PSA / agent-cover = already off; default for RepUK WhatsApp = leave on unless the user names RepUK WhatsApp.
